# NK conformance driver nkc-seh-fatal, control code 00222400:
# an exception raised in the dispatch routine, inside the
# requestor's system call. Nothing handles it; see the top of
# nk-fixtures nkc/nkc-seh-fatal.c. The request stops the system. If it
# completes instead, its status says what went wrong.

load nkc-seh-fatal nkc-seh-fatal.sys
open d \Device\NkcSehFatal
ioctl d 00222000 - 16
ioctl d 00222400 - 16
close d
unload nkc-seh-fatal
